@prefix bpot: <https://fandaws.com/ontology/bpot#> .
@prefix cco: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix obo: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

bpot:CustomerRole rdfs:comment "Borne by the (organizational or individual) customer; recurs in customer-test and market-review processes (2.1.2.5, 2.3.2.2)." .

bpot:GoNoGoDecision rdfs:comment "Reused naming from the reference module. Directive: a decision prescribes. Used where corporate decisions gate development (2.2.3 narrative)." .

bpot:PCF_10061 bpot:designatesProcessType bpot:ProductServicePortfolioManagementCapability .

